play text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-display transition-colors duration-150 group-hover/title:text-accent-text">Give any website a WebMCP interface</h2></a><p class="text-base leading-7 text-text/70">Today we&#39;re launching a developer preview of WebMCP on Cloudflare. With one switch, any site becomes usable by browser AI agents — no new APIs, no origin changes — while the human stays in control and creators keep their traffic.</p><div class="bylines"><div class="avatar-stack"><span class="avatar" style="--avatar-size: 32px" data-avatar data-astro-cid-u5m3xj5o><img src="/_image?href=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.cloudflare.com%2F_emdash%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2F01KZ9RTXYC845D1Y5KJHYETK71.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;h=64&amp;f=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;position=center" srcset="/_image?href=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.cloudflare.com%2F_emdash%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2F01KZ9RTXYC845D1Y5KJHYETK71.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;h=64&amp;f=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;position=center 64w, /_image?href=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.cloudflare.com%2F_emdash%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2F01KZ9RTXYC845D1Y5KJHYETK71.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;h=128&amp;f=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;position=center 128w" alt="Will Rowe" data-astro-cid-u5m3xj5o="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="64px" data-astro-image="fixed" data-astro-image-fit="cover" data-astro-image-pos="center" width="64" height="64" class="avatar__image"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="avatar__fallback" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-u5m3xj5o><path fill="#fff" d="M3.513 18.998C4.749 15.504 8.082 13 12 13s7.251 2.504 8.487 5.998C18.47 21.442 15.417 23 12 23s-6.47-1.558-8.487-4.002zM12 12c2.21 0 4-2.79 4-5s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 5 4 5z" data-astro-cid-u5m3xj5o></path></svg></span></div><p class="m-0 flex flex-wrap items-baseline text-sm leading-5 text-text"><span class="whitespace-nowrap"><a href="/author/will-rowe/" class="inline-block py-1 font-medium no-underline text-inherit hover:text-accent-text transition-colors duration-150"><bdi>Will Rowe</bd